@startuml Sequence Diagram - Admin Product Management Flow

actor Admin
participant "AdminController" as AC
participant "AdminProductController" as APC
participant "AdminCategoryController" as ACC
participant "Product Model" as Product
participant "Category Model" as Category
participant "Order Model" as Order
participant "User Model" as User
participant "Excel Service" as Excel

== Dashboard ==
Admin -> AC: Access Dashboard
AC -> Product: Count Products
Product --> AC: Product Count
AC -> Category: Count Categories
Category --> AC: Category Count
AC -> Order: Count Orders & Revenue
Order --> AC: Order Stats
AC -> User: Count Users
User --> AC: User Count
AC --> Admin: Display Dashboard

== Product Management ==
Admin -> APC: View Products
APC -> Product: Get All Products
Product --> APC: Product List
APC --> Admin: Display Products

Admin -> APC: Create Product
APC -> Category: Get Categories
Category --> APC: Category List
APC --> Admin: Show Create Form
Admin -> APC: Submit Product Data
APC -> Product: Validate & Create
Product --> APC: Product Created
APC --> Admin: Success Message

Admin -> APC: Edit Product
APC -> Product: Get Product
Product --> APC: Product Data
APC -> Category: Get Categories
Category --> APC: Category List
APC --> Admin: Show Edit Form
Admin -> APC: Update Product
APC -> Product: Validate & Update
Product --> APC: Product Updated
APC --> Admin: Success Message

Admin -> APC: Delete Product
APC -> Product: Delete Product
Product --> APC: Deleted
APC --> Admin: Success Message

Admin -> APC: Export Products
APC -> Excel: Export to Excel
Excel -> Product: Get Products
Product --> Excel: Product Data
Excel --> APC: Excel File
APC --> Admin: Download Excel

Admin -> APC: Import Products
Admin -> APC: Upload Excel File
APC -> Excel: Import from Excel
Excel -> Product: Create/Update Products
Product --> Excel: Import Result
Excel --> APC: Import Status
APC --> Admin: Import Complete

== Category Management ==
Admin -> ACC: View Categories
ACC -> Category: Get All Categories
Category --> ACC: Category List
ACC --> Admin: Display Categories

Admin -> ACC: Create Category
ACC --> Admin: Show Create Form
Admin -> ACC: Submit Category Data
ACC -> Category: Validate & Create
Category --> ACC: Category Created
ACC --> Admin: Success Message

Admin -> ACC: Edit Category
ACC -> Category: Get Category
Category --> ACC: Category Data
ACC --> Admin: Show Edit Form
Admin -> ACC: Update Category
ACC -> Category: Validate & Update
Category --> ACC: Category Updated
ACC --> Admin: Success Message

Admin -> ACC: Delete Category
ACC -> Category: Delete Category
Category --> ACC: Deleted
ACC --> Admin: Success Message

== Order Management ==
Admin -> AC: View All Orders
AC -> Order: Get All Orders with Users & Products
Order --> AC: Order List
AC --> Admin: Display Orders

Admin -> AC: Delete Order
AC -> Order: Delete Order
Order --> AC: Deleted
AC --> Admin: Success Message

== Customer Management ==
Admin -> AC: View Customers
AC -> User: Get All Users
User --> AC: User List
AC --> Admin: Display Customers

Admin -> AC: Activate Customer
AC -> User: Update Status (Active)
User --> AC: Updated
AC --> Admin: Customer Activated

Admin -> AC: Deactivate Customer
AC -> User: Update Status (Inactive)
User --> AC: Updated
AC --> Admin: Customer Deactivated

Admin -> AC: Delete Customer
AC -> User: Soft Delete User
User --> AC: Deleted
AC --> Admin: Customer Deleted

== Reports ==
Admin -> AC: View Reports
AC -> Order: Get Order Statistics
Order --> AC: Order Stats
AC -> Product: Get Product Statistics
Product --> AC: Product Stats
AC --> Admin: Display Reports

@enduml

